  "historyNote": "#4230, eff 2-23-87; ss by #4946, eff 10-2-90; amd by #5587, eff 2-22-93; ss by #6634, eff 11-25-97; ss by #8242, eff 12-30-04; ss by #9172, eff 6-6-08; ss by #12033, eff 11-3-16; amd by #12586, eff 7-24-18",
